  "context": {
    "explanation_en": "Beyond basic comparatives: 'as ... as' for equal comparison ('as tall as'), 'twice/three times as ... as' for multiples ('twice as expensive as'), and 'nowhere near as ... as' for a big gap ('nowhere near as easy as').",
    "explanation_ko": "기본 비교급을 넘어서: 동등 비교에는 'as ... as'('as tall as'), 배수 비교에는 'twice/three times as ... as'('twice as expensive as'), 큰 차이에는 'nowhere near as ... as'('nowhere near as easy as')를 씁니다.",
    "key_expressions": [
      {
        "en": "This test was twice as hard as the last one.",
        "ko": "이 시험은 지난번 시험보다 두 배 어려웠어요."
      },
      {
        "en": "It's nowhere near as expensive as I thought.",
        "ko": "생각했던 것만큼 비싸지 않아요."
      },
      {
        "en": "She's just as talented as her sister.",
        "ko": "그녀는 언니만큼 재능이 있어요."
      }
    ]
  },
